    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberfly</strong> is a first-person single-player horror game set in Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to escape from a dream that feels real but isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror</strong> - Single player in first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and puzzles</strong> - Find hidden clues and solve simple puzzles (easy).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase scenes</strong> - Run away to avoid being caught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime </strong>- The first playtime is about 30-60 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 There are 3 endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you wake up in an empty school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea why you're here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime and the lights are off, so everything is dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't know why, but luckily I have a flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to find a way out of here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icons by Icons8</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberfly</strong> is a first-person single-player horror game set in Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to escape from a dream that feels real but isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror</strong> - Single player in first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and puzzles</strong> - Find hidden clues and solve simple puzzles (easy).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase scenes</strong> - Run away to avoid being caught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime </strong>- The first playtime is about 30-60 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 There are 3 endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you wake up in an empty school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea why you're here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime and the lights are off, so everything is dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't know why, but luckily I have a flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to find a way out of here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icons by Icons8</p>",
    "short_description": "Emberfly is a horror game set in Korea. One day, you wake up at school. The outside is dark, and no one seems to be around. Relying on the flashlight in your hand, you must find a way to escape from this dream that feels real but isn't.",
